    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsoso kūfuma mu mīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūbawīla a ba Musa nū Alooni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūngalūngagi nabo a Baisilaeli mubawīle gīkī, “Ūlū munhū ngosha ūsaata būsaatu bo kūfuma minzī minzī mu mīlī gwakwe, īsho shilīmfuma shenīsho shilī shisoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū wei shikūng'wenheleja kūbiza nsoso, shibize shikūselaga būl'ikanza, nūūlū ū mīlī gwakwe gwachibije; alī nsoso ū ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo būsoso būkūmfumaga mu mīlī ūlū ūlaala ha būlīīlī, ūbūlobya nī shisho shikūmfumaga, būkūsosohala; nūūlū wigaasha ha shikolo shose shose, shikūsosohala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ūyo ūbūkuumya ū būlīīlī wa munhū ng'wenūyo, akūbiza nsoso; akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī, hūna wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ū wa kwigaasīja shikolo īsho shaalī shigaasījiagwa na munhū akūfumagwa būsoso, akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī; hūna wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ose ose ūyo ūnkuumya munhū ūyo akūfumagwa būsoso, akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī; hama wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū munhū ūyo akūfumagwa būsoso ūlū ūng'wigaasīja munhū, ūyo wigaasījiagwa ng'wenūyo akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī; hūna wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūlū wigaasīja shose shose alī mu lūgendo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Alī mu lūgendo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abize adamhīlile ndamhī, nūūlū alī mu modoka.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " īsho alashigaasīje shikūsosohala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na būlī ose ose ūyo ūshikuumya ī shikolo īsho shaalī shigaasījiagwa na munhū wa kūfung'wa būsoso, nang'hwe akūbiza nsoso kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla; ū wa kūshibūūcha ī shikolo shenīsho akwigeleelwa kūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī; hama wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo akūfumagwa būsoso ūlū ūnkuumya munhū ose ose alīyo atakalabile a makono gaakwe, ūyo wakuumiagwa ng'wenūyo akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī; hama wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūlū ūkuumya nungū, īkūbelagūlwa; ūlū shiseme sha līntī shikoojiwa mu minzī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū munhū wa kūfung'wa būsoso ūlū ūpīla, akūdīīla shikū mpungatī alī ng'wikanza lya kwejiwa; ūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga nū mīlī gwakwe mu minzī ga kūsela, hūna wela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa kanaane akūsola mhunda ibīlī nūūlū ng'hune ibīlī ja ng'hūūlū wiza najo kū būtongi wang'wa SEEBA, ū kū nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla, ūng'winha ngabīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūjisīnza, īmò kūlwa shitambò sha shibi, ī yīngī yūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva. Ū mu nzīla yenīyo ū ngabīji akūmeegeja isangī kūlī SEEBA, kūlwa nguno ya būsaatu wakwe ū wa kūfung'wa būsoso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū ngosha ūlū wiloteela, akooga mu minzī pyī ū mīlī; hūna wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wenda gose gose ūlū ūgwilooteelela shiigelile gūfulwe, ūlū ndīlī yoojiwe; shikwikala shilī shisoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngosha ūlū ūlaala na nkīma, a bose būbīlī wabo īkūbigeleelwa kooga mu minzī, hūna bakwikala basoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo kūlwa bakīma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū nkīma wingīla ng'wikanza lyakwe lya ng'weji, akūbiza nsoso ikanza lya shikū mpungatī kūlwa mininga gaakwe. Ose ose ūyo ūnkuumya akūsosohala kūshisha līīmi līlibīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lya būsoso bokwe, shose shose īsho ūshilaalīla shikūsosohala, na būlī shene īsho ūshigaasīja shikūsosohala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ūyo ūkuumya būlīīlī wakwe ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī; hama wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū munhū ose ose ūkuumya shikolo īsho shigaasījiagwa nū nkīma ng'wenūyo, ū munhū ng'wenūyo akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī; hama wikala alī nsoso gīko kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ūbiza walī wigaashaga ha būlīīlī, hūna munhū ūbūkuumya, ū munhū ng'wenūyo akūbiza nsoso kūshisha līīmi līlibīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ngosha ūlaala nū nkīma ng'wenūyo hūna gūnkuumya a mininga ga ng'wikanza lyakwe, ū ngosha ng'wenūyo akūbiza nsoso kūshisha shikū mpungatī; na būlī būlīīlī ūbo ūbūlaalīla būkūsosohala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
