          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A Baisilaeli mukūbalekanya nabo ū būsoso wabo mu nzīla yenīyo, batizūchīla mo ū mu būsoso wabo, na kūlīsosohaja ī lipandī lyane ī lya kwikala, īlo līlī hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagaīlo shenīshi shilī kūlwa būlī ngosha ūyo ūsaata būsaatu wa kūfung'wa būsoso mu mīlī, nūūlū ūyo wisosohaja kūlwa kwilooteela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kūlwa būlī nkīma ūyo alī ng'wikanza lyakwe lya ng'weji, na ose ose, ngosha nūūlū nkīma, ūyo akūfumagwa būsoso mu mīlī gwakwe; nūūlū ngosha ūyo ūlaala na nkīma alī ng'wikanza lyakwe lya būsoso.”",
          "type": "text",
